  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on the results of an earlier initiative to enhance women&#x2019;s roles in building community resilience and in the further implementation of the Bangsamoro peace process, this Project will aim to contribute to advancing women&#x2019;s roles in conflict-prevention, peacebuilding and governance in the Bangsamoro through the following initiatives: (1) assessment and updating of the Bangsamoro Regional Action Plan on Women, Peace and Security; (2) accompaniment of the MILF Bangsamoro Islamic Women Auxil</narrative>
  </description>
